#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:21
msgid "Here various settings for the rendering of Krita can be edited."
msgstr "Tukaj lahko urejate različne nastavitve za upodabljanje Krite."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:26
msgid ""
"**For Krita 3.3 or later: Reworded as \"*Canvas Graphics Acceleration*\"**"
msgstr ""
"**Za Krito 3.3 ali kasnejše: preimenovano v »*Grafično pospeševanje "
"platna*«**"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:28
msgid ""
"OpenGL is a bit of code especially for graphics cards. Graphics cards a "
"dedicate piece of hardware for helping your computer out with graphics "
"calculations, which Krita uses a lot. All modern computer have graphics "
"cards."
msgstr ""
"OpenGL je del kode, posebej namenjen grafičnim karticam. Grafična kartica je "
"namenski kos strojne opreme za pomoč računalniku pri grafičnih izračunih, ki "
"jih Krita veliko uporablja. Vsi sodobni računalniki imajo grafične kartice."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:30
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**For Krita 3.3 or later:** On Windows, Krita also supports using Direct3D "
"instead with the help of the ANGLE library. ANGLE works by converting the "
"OpenGL functions that Krita makes use of to the equivalent in Direct3D. It "
"may (or may not) be slower than native OpenGL, but it has better "
"compatibility with typical Windows graphics drivers."
msgstr ""
"**Za Krita 3.3 ali kasnejše:** V operacijskem sistemu Windows krita podpira "
"tudi uporabo Direct3D namesto tega s pomočjo ANGLE knjižnice. ANGLE deluje "
"tako, da pretvori funkcije OpenGL, ki jih Krita uporablja v ekvivalent v "
"Direct3D. Morda je (ali pa ne) počasneje od native OpenGL, vendar ima boljšo "
"združljivost s tipičnimi grafičnimi gonilniki sistema Windows."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:32
msgid ""
"Enable OpenGL **(For Krita 3.3 or later: Reworded as *Canvas Graphics "
"Acceleration*)**"
msgstr ""
"Omogoči OpenGL **(za Krita 3.3 ali kasnejše: preimenovano v *Pospeševanje "
"grafike platna*)**"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:33
msgid ""
"Selecting this checkbox will enable the OpenGL / ANGLE canvas drawing mode. "
"With a decent graphics card this should give faster feedback on brushes and "
"tools. Also the canvas operations like Rotate, Zoom and Pan should be "
"considerably faster."
msgstr ""
"Če potrdite to polje, boste omogočili način risanja na platnu OpenGL / "
"ANGLE. Z dostojno grafično kartico dobite hitrejše odzivanje čopičev in "
"orodij. Tudi operacije platna, kot so zasuki, primiki in vrtenje, bi morale "
"biti precej hitrejše."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:35
msgid "For Krita 3.3 or later:"
msgstr "Za Krito 3.3 ali novejše:"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:35
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "Upodobljevalnik"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:36
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"*On Windows:* You can switch between native OpenGL or ANGLE Direct3D 11 "
"rendering. The usual recommendation is to leave it as \"Auto\", which Krita "
"will decide the best to use based on some internal compatibility checking. "
"Changes to this option require a restart of Krita to take effect."
msgstr ""
"*V operacijskem sistemu Windows:* Preklapljate lahko med domorodnim openGL "
"ali ANGLE Direct3D 11 ugasnjenjem. Običajno priporočilo je, da ga pustite "
"kot \"Auto\", ki se bo Krita odločila, da bo najboljša za uporabo na podlagi "
"nekaterih notranjih preverjanj združljivosti. Spremembe te možnosti "
"zahtevajo, da začne krita znova začeti veljati."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:37
msgid "Use Texture Buffer"
msgstr "Uporabi medpomnilnik tekstur"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:38
msgid ""
"This setting utilizes the graphics card's buffering capabilities to speed "
"things up a bit. Although for now, this feature may be broken on some AMD/"
"Radeon cards and may work fine on some Intel graphics cards."
msgstr ""
"Ta nastavitev uporablja zmogljivosti medpomnjenja grafične kartice za "
"pospešitev delovanja. Za zdaj ta funkcija morda ne deluje na nekaterih "
"karticah AMD/Radeon in lahko deluje na nekaterih grafičnih karticah Intel."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:40
msgid ""
"The user can choose which scaling mode to use while zooming the canvas. The "
"choice here only affects the way the image is displayed during canvas "
"operations and has no effect on how Krita scales an image when a "
"transformation is applied."
msgstr ""
"Uporabnik lahko izbere način povečave, ki ga bo uporabil med povečavo "
"platna. Izbira tukaj vpliva le na način prikaza slike med operacijami na "
"platnu in nima nobenega vpliva na to, kako Krita ob uporabi transformacije "
"spreminja velikost slike."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:42
msgid "Nearest Neighbour"
msgstr "Najbližji sosed"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:43
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is the fastest and crudest filtering method. While fast, this results "
"in a large number of artifacts - 'blockiness' during magnification, and "
"aliasing and shimmering during minification."
msgstr ""
"To je najhitrejša in najbolj kruta metoda filtriranja. Čeprav hitro, to ima "
"za rezultat veliko število artefaktov - \"blokado\" med povečavo, in "
"aliasing in šmirjenje med miniranje."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:44
msgid "Bilinear Filtering"
msgstr "Bilinearno filtriranje"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:45
msgid ""
"This is the next step up. This removes the 'blockiness' seen during "
"magnification and gives a smooth looking result. For most purposes this "
"should be a good trade-off between speed and quality."
msgstr ""
"To je naslednji korak navzgor. S tem se odstrani »kockastost«, opazna pri "
"povečavi, in zagotavlja gladek videz. Za večino namenov bi to moralo nuditi "
"dobro razmerje med hitrostjo in kakovostjo."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:46
msgid "Trilinear Filtering"
msgstr "Trilinearno filtriranje"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:47
msgid "This should give a little better result than Bilinear Filtering."
msgstr "To bi moralo dati malo boljši rezultat kot bilinearno filtriranje."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:49
msgid "Scaling Mode"
msgstr "Način spreminjanja merila"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:49
msgid "High Quality Filtering"
msgstr "Filtriranje visoke kakovosti"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:49
msgid ""
"Only available when your graphics card supports OpenGL 3.0. As the name "
"suggests, this setting provides the best looking image during canvas "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"Na voljo je le, če grafična kartica podpira OpenGL 3.0. Kot pove ime, ta "
"nastavitev zagotavlja najboljšo podobo pri operacijah na platnu."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:54
msgid "HDR"
msgstr "HDR"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:58
msgid "These settings are only available when using Windows."
msgstr "Te nastavitve so na voljo samo pri uporabi sistema Windows."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:60
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since 4.2 Krita can not just edit floating point images, but also render "
"them on screen in a way that an HDR capable setup can show them as HDR "
"images."
msgstr ""
"Ker 4.2 Krita ne more le urejati slike s plavajoče točke, temveč jih tudi "
"ureja na zaslonu na način, da jih nastavitev, sposobna HDR, lahko prikaže "
"kot slike HDR."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:62
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The HDR settings will show you the display format that Krita can handle, and "
"the current output format. You will want to set the preferred output format "
"to the one closest to what your display can handle to make full use of it."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve HDR vam bodo pokazale obliko zaslona, s katero Krita zmore "
"ravnati, in trenutno izhodno obliko. Želeno izhodno obliko boste želeli "
"nastaviti na tisto, ki je najbližje temu, s čemer lahko vaš zaslon ravna, da "
"ga bo v celoti uporabil."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:64
msgid "Display Format"
msgstr "Oblika prikaza"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:65
msgid ""
"The format your display is in by default. If this isn't higher than 8bit, "
"there's a good chance your monitor is not an HDR monitor as far as Krita can "
"tell. This can be a hardware issue, but also a graphics driver issue. Check "
"if other HDR applications, or the system HDR settings are configured "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"Oblika prikaza je privzeta. Če to ni višje od 8 bitov, obstaja velika "
"verjetnost, da vaš zaslon ni HDR, vsaj kakor lahko Krita to ugotovi. Gre "
"lahko za težavo s strojno opremo, pa tudi težave z grafičnimi gonilniki. "
"Preverite, ali so nastavitve HDR drugih programov ali sistemske nastavitve "
"HDR pravilno prilagojene."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:66
msgid "Current Output format"
msgstr "Trenutna izhodna oblika"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:67
msgid "What Krita is rendering the canvas to currently."
msgstr "V kaj Krita trenutno upodablja platno."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:69
msgid "Preferred Output Format"
msgstr "Želena izhodna oblika"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:69
msgid ""
"Which surface type you prefer. This should be ideally the closest to the "
"display format, but perhaps due to driver issues you might want to try other "
"formats. This requires a restart."
msgstr ""
"Katera vrsta površine vam je ljubša. To bi moralo biti v najboljšem primeru "
"najbližje obliki prikaza, vendar želite zaradi težav z gonilniki morda "
"poskusiti druge oblike zapisa. To zahteva ponovno zagon."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:72
msgid "Transparency Checkerboard"
msgstr "Šahovnica prosojnosti"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:74
msgid ""
"Krita supports layer transparency. Of course, the nasty thing is that "
"transparency can't be seen. So to indicate transparency at the lowest layer, "
"we use a checker pattern. This part allows you to configure it."
msgstr ""
"Krita podpira prosojnost plasti. Seveda je težava, da prosojnosti ni mogoče "
"videti. Da bi nakazali prosojnost na najnižji plasti, uporabljamo vzorec "
"šahovnice. Ta del vam omogoča, da ga prilagodite."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:76
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Velikost"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:77
msgid ""
"This sets the size of the checkers which show up in transparent parts of an "
"image."
msgstr ""
"To določa velikost polj vzorca šahovnice, ki se prikaže na prosojnih delih "
"slike."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:79
#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:84
#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:94
#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:106
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Barva"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:79
msgid "The user can set the colors for the checkers over here."
msgstr "Tukaj lahko uporabnik nastavi barve vzorca šahovnice."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:85
msgid ""
"The user can select the color for the canvas i.e. the space beyond a "
"document's boundaries."
msgstr ""
"Uporabnik lahko izbere barvo za platno, t. j. prostor, ki presega meje "
"dokumenta."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:87
msgid "Hide Scrollbars"
msgstr "Skrij drsnike"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:87
msgid "Selecting this will hide the scrollbars in all view modes."
msgstr ""
"Če izberete to nastavitev, boste drsnike skrili v vseh načinih pogleda."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:90
msgid "Selection Overlay"
msgstr "Prekrivanje izbora"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:92
msgid ""
"Set the color of the alternate :ref:`Selection <selections_basics>` display "
"mode. This mode is typically used when making complex selections."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite barvo nadomestnega načina prikaza :ref:`Izbor "
"<selections_basics>`. Ta način se običajno uporablja pri izdelavi zapletenih "
"izborov."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:95
msgid "Color of the overlay."
msgstr "Barva prekrivanja."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:97
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Prekrivnost"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:97
msgid "How opaque the overlay is."
msgstr "Kako prekrivno je prekrivanje."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:100
msgid "Pixel Grid"
msgstr "Mreža slikovnih točk"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:104
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This allows configuring an automatic pixel-by-pixel grid, which is very "
"useful for doing pixel art."
msgstr ""
"To omogoča prilagajanje samodejne mreže slikovne točke za slikovno točko, ki "
"je zelo uporabna za delo s slikanjem slikovnih točk."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:107
msgid "The color of the grid."
msgstr "Barva mreže."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:109
msgid "Start Showing at"
msgstr "Začni prikazovanje pri"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:109
msgid ""
"This determines the zoom level at which the pixel grid starts showing, as "
"showing it when the image is zoomed out a lot will make the grid overwhelm "
"the image, and is thus counter productive."
msgstr ""
"S tem se določi raven povečave, na kateri se začne prikazovati mreža "
"slikovnih točk, saj bo prikazovanje, ko je slika zelo pomanjšana, mreža "
"preplavi sliko in je tako povsem neproduktivna."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:112
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr "Razno"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:114
msgid "Hide canvas scrollbars."
msgstr "Skrij drsnike platna."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:115
msgid "Hides the scrollbars on the canvas."
msgstr "Skrije drsne trakove na platnu."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:116
msgid "Enable Curve Anti-Aliasing"
msgstr "Omogoči glajenje krivulj"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:117
msgid ""
"This allows anti-aliasing on previewing curves, like the ones for the circle "
"tool, or the path tool."
msgstr ""
"To omogoča glajenje pri predogledu krivulj, kot so tiste za orodje kroga ali "
"orodje poti."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:118
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Hide layer thumbnail popup"
msgid "Hide Layer thumbnail popup"
msgstr "Skrij pojavno ogledno sličico plasti"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:119
msgid "This disables the thumbnail that you get when hovering over a layer."
msgstr ""
"To onemogoči ogledno sličico, ki jo vidite pri postoju kazalca nad plastjo."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:120
msgid "Color Channels in Color"
msgstr "Barvni kanali v barvi"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:121
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This configures whether the image display should be colored when only a "
"single channel is selected in the channels docker."
msgstr ""
"To konfigurira, ali naj bo prikaz slike obarvan, ko je izbran samo en kanal "
"v dockerju kanalov."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:122
msgid "Enable Selection Outline Anti-Aliasing"
msgstr "Omogoči glajenje robov orisa izbora"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:123
msgid ""
"This allows automatic anti-aliasing on selection. It makes the selection "
"feel less jaggy and more precise."
msgstr ""
"To omogoča samodejno glajenje na izboru. Zaradi tega daje izbor občutek "
"manjše nazobčanosti in večje natančnosti."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/display_settings.rst:125
msgid ""
"When selected the checkers will move along with opaque elements of an image "
"during canvas Panning, Zooming, etc.  Otherwise the checkers remain "
"stationary and only the opaque parts of an image will move."
msgstr ""
"Ko izberete to možnost, se šahovnica premika skupaj s prekrivnimi elementi "
"slike med sukanjem, približevanjem itn. platna.  V nasprotnem primeru "
"šahovnica ostane nepremična in premaknejo se le prekrivni deli slike."
